The Slovak (Slovak WordNet) and Lithuanian (Lithuanian WordNet) dictionary in src/translations/ is derived from this wordnet, as distributed in the Open
Multilingual Wordnet 1.4 (https://omwn.org/). Onyx changed it: for each English word it chose the wordnet's commonest
words, and for each of the wordnet's words the commonest English ones. The derived file is distributed under the
same license as the wordnet.

The data file's own header: # Lithuanian  WordNet	lit	http://korpus.juls.savba.sk/ltskwn_en.html	CC BY SA 3.0

